        <div class="hero-badge">Available for new opportunities</div>

        <h1 class="hero-name">Nikolaos<br />Prevenios</h1>
        <p class="hero-title">
            <span class="highlight">.NET Developer</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp;
            C# &nbsp;|&nbsp; Blazor &nbsp;|&nbsp; API
        </p>
        <p class="hero-description">
            Junior system developer based in Linköping, Sweden.
            Passionate about clean, structured code and building backend solutions
            that make a real difference. Currently working at
            <strong style="color:var(--text-primary)">Releasy Customer Management</strong>.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="#projects" class="btn-primary-custom" @onclick='() => ScrollTo("projects")'>
